{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>【ACGHK 2026】「CosParadise」Cosplay 圖集！「艾梅絲」、「超天醬」等高品質 Cosplay 區域</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/7029919497ec32ee6041a469b911ce13d85205dd07c51d2c0f6871a1efc4f93a/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fe19841f730e0323b179611a638ece2f1.jpg\"/><p>2026年7月24日（五）至7月28日（二）舉行的「 ACGHK 2026 」，也就是「Ani-Com &amp; Games Hong Kong 2026（香港動漫電玩節2026）」。 這次為大家帶來的是匯聚來自世界各地 Cosplayer 的「CosParadise」現場圖集！</p><h3>ACGHK 2026 匯聚香港 Cosplayer！</h3><p>「綾波麗（暫稱）」</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/e11d5432bb6b92c0fd34b8af074e524ea4566e2f268e5c99f57a91c5d48bae43/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fecaedfcedf891c206f6c5e2d5705a29f.jpg\"/><p>「CosParadise」區域內聚集了許多高品質的 Cosplayer！ 首先登場的是《新世紀福音戰士》的綾波麗（暫稱）！</p><p>「卡斯特莉絲」</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/2dee13691c8412099249d7b7cf2d4cf06c4789f38d8c38de8a3343b7ee72477b/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F20dc42bead31e21bc99527173df8d5fd.jpg\"/><p>接下來是《崩壞：星穹鐵道》的卡斯特莉絲。</p><p>左起「波特卡斯・D・艾斯」「克勞德・史特萊夫」</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/fc16fba47c6f41ac1e69e668311133f7ff91c9a00058d5f2993cafea133e5c13/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Feeda8de9431310220430cf18714d2bb7.jpg\"/><p>《ONE PIECE》的波特卡斯・D・艾斯，以及《FINAL FANTASY VII》的克勞德・史特萊夫。 當然也有男性 Cosplayer！</p><p>「超天醬」</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/866a1475d182169df4e2a9fe277e8168e6e4fd3deff49d0ee55ac7278fc4f951/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fda6f705bb823320052c0e3f0f2b3d2d6.jpg\"/><p>《NEEDY GIRL OVERDOSE》的超天醬。</p><p>左起「尼古喵喵」、「嗑藥貓」、「性愛貓」</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/03c94061e224997ae3e26dbd450e50be416cb61af4a78f972dc14d0d24cb78a2/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F991bb912fc63f3dc6dfe9e42c592ced2.jpg\"/><p>《菸草貓》中的菸尼古喵喵、嗑藥貓、性愛貓三人。</p><p>左起「艾達・王」「里昂・S・甘迺迪」</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/f5d1417ba9f272c908810470a2abdcc3ad053524cf027663c2af480410526bb4/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F45ce54a14ea20696b0f1b9b7538d3bf7.jpg\"/><p>《惡靈古堡》系列的艾達・王與里昂・S・甘迺迪。</p><p>「愛彌斯」</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/980ae9195d4a1513bcec32863e4a2bfbdd1fb3163cdb9e3ff27bf8140d2f1d54/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Feff434d25095f3e9371bceb4df6ab234.jpg\"/><p>《鳴潮》的愛彌斯。</p><p>「皮托屬」</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/8686624b48fc3ee5d2a852ea434953f9a44f463e6b803b0549ad7f94b5dc7f48/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F58eafd525e96503be734bbecb6b53109.jpg\"/><p>《刀劍神域外傳 Gun Gale Online》的皮托屬。</p><p>「星之守護者 凱莎」「星之守護者 阿璃」</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/5e8043eff9c56d0c1275c01edf4b6d8bda70f81c8669969e5afc6c7d46ea62a8/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fa3a7c3e4684e3fb86ac976f9ef692036.jpg\"/><p>《英雄聯盟》的星之守護者 凱莎與星之守護者 阿璃。</p><p>「夏爾米」</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/be8a83cd131961ef72a3742cbf77c3905be190fb1245e5a178ec56c1d91bb933/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fe7f0998ea2e6954d12098583bd24dfda.jpg\"/><p>《拳皇》的夏爾米。</p><p>「八握劍異戒神將魔虛羅」</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/13f8b1da9e325cb126d790389aa1ca2ab76fce3802bc277f9ca23e16cf94ae5b/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Ff6cf1f5b6f185a6a7b3ff4e53e8bc7af.jpg\"/><p>《咒術迴戰》的「魔虛羅」，也就是八握劍異戒神將魔虛羅。</p><p>「琳奈」</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/01ce2f92b98649ad2d69d6313b6fc95d87620f78fe066f5bf345e4597ae70c7a/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F8de35d86494e9eaf95c462e95a492cb5.jpg\"/><p>最後是《鳴潮》的琳奈。</p><p>以上就是這次 ACGHK 2026「CosParadise」的 Cosplay 圖集，現場聚集了許多能感受到對角色熱愛的 Cosplayer！</p><p>🔸【ACGHK 2026】「港漫動力 HK Comics Support Programme」攤位報導！香港17位新銳漫畫家全新作品一次集結 🔸【ACGHK 2026】「ElefunPop(潮巨匠)」攤位報導！世界頂尖藝術家齊聚一堂 🔸【C108】崩壞：星穹鐵道×Fate/stay night [Unlimited Blade Works]聯名紀念拍照區Cosplayer登場 🔸【ACGHK 2026】「白銀之城」展位報導！可盡情沉浸於世界觀的拍照打卡點與試玩區等 🔸【C108】Comiket除臭閘門、土屋工業、大都技研＆京樂産業．攤位報導！痛車LEXUS及SAO新機種展示</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-24T11:18:11.724462+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1081,"images":13,"source":"Yahoo 科技","fallback":"none"}}